# By default, ignore all user-installed (runtime) plugins except the ones
# we ship with this fork. All 3rd-party plugins installed via Xboard admin
# should still be ignored by Git (they're persisted in the `plugins/` volume
# via docker-compose anyway).

*
!.gitignore

# === Our bundled plugins (must ship with the fork repo) ===
!OlcRTC
!OlcRTC/**
